  speakerName: "PH\xD3 L\xDD"
  title: "Tham quan l\xE0ng"
  content: "Nh\xECn xung quanh \u0111i. Khu d\xE2n c\u01B0 \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y, kho
    ch\u1EE9a ph\xEDa kia, tuy\u1EBFn ph\xF2ng th\u1EE7 \u1EDF xa h\u01A1n. C\u1EADu
    c\u1EA7n n\u1EAFm r\xF5 t\u1EEBng khu \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111i\u1EC1u h\xE0nh l\xE0ng."
